{"id":"83430c3c47df7abe","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-ce-complement.md","title":"可判定集与双重可枚举","display":"thm-ce-complement — 可判定集与双重可枚举","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-ce-complement","aliases":["43-thm-ce-complement"],"display":"thm-ce-complement — 可判定集与双重可枚举","depends_on":["[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-computable]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Definition 5.2.1 and following discussion, print p.10 / PDF p.30","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-ce-complement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-ce-complement</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ce-complement — 可判定集与双重可枚举"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Definition 5.2.1 and following discussion, print p.10 / PDF p.30"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Computable}^B(\\chi_A)\\leftrightarrow(\\operatorname{CE}^B(A)\\land\\operatorname{CE}^B(\\mathbb N\\setminus A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Computable}^B(\\chi_A)\\leftrightarrow(\\operatorname{CE}^B(A)\\land\\operatorname{CE}^B(\\mathbb N\\setminus A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>并行枚举A与其补，对每个输入必有一个枚举发现它；反向分别在特征值为1或0时停机。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 5.2.1 and following discussion, print p.10 / PDF p.30。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Computable}^B(\\chi_A)\\leftrightarrow(\\operatorname{CE}^B(A)\\land\\operatorname{CE}^B(\\mathbb N\\setminus A)).","display":true}],"bytes":1081,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-46","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-ce-complement]] — 可判定集与双重可枚举"}],"outgoing":["6c0559518cd32104","f357216a7edb035a"]}